  "query_preview": "..\n\nWEATHER PATTERN OVERVIEW:\nAn upper level ridge will slowly be building in starting today, so\ntemperatures will continue to rise closer to normal highs by\nThursday. \n\nThe GFS and ECMWF ensembles are suggesting a flattening of the\nridge on Sunday, so low chances of precipitation and thunderstorms have\npotential to move in by then. \n\nFORECAST CONFIDENCE & DEVIATIONS:\nThere are no deviations.\n\nThere is high confidence in temperatures through the weekend.\n\nThere is moderate to high confidence in critical fire weather\noccurring on Thursday.\n\nThere is low confidence in accumulating precipitation starting on\nSunday.",
